      "factual_description": "Billboard Live Yokohama presents Ryo Takaiwa on Tuesday, November 3, 2026, with stages at 4:00 PM and 7:00 PM. The engagement is part of Takaiwa's first Billboard Live tour and is announced as a performance with a new Ryo Takaiwa Big Band; the venue currently names Takaiwa on vocals and leaves the additional personnel to be announced. Billboard describes Takaiwa's path from jazz vocalist at age 18 through SANABAGUN., THE THROTTLE, electronic project INF and his jazz album TAKAIWA, and frames the Yokohama date as a large-scale club presentation of his current cross-genre work. The tour continues at Billboard Live Osaka on November 13, 2026.",
